# ExamPrep AI: Learn Smarter. Prepare Better.

An AI-powered exam preparation platform. Students turn study material into simplified notes, quizzes and study plans, build personalised learning roadmaps, and keep a daily study streak.

Built for the hackathon theme **Artificial Intelligence in Education**.

---

## Features

| Page | What it does |
|---|---|
| **Landing** | Product intro, features and "How it works". |
| **Dashboard** | Study-streak calendar at the top, then quizzes attempted, average score, best score, notes saved, goal completion %, tasks completed, goals overview, recent activity, upcoming tasks and topics to revise. |
| **Roadmap** | Enter a course, subject or tech field, then pick your level, duration (4 / 8 / 12 / 24 weeks) and hours per week. Gemini builds a phase-by-phase roadmap with topics, a practice task and an outcome for each phase. Choose a goal sticker, save the roadmap as a goal, and tick topics as you finish them. |
| **Notes** | Upload a PDF (max 5 MB) or paste text. Get an overview, key concepts, definitions and a revision summary. Copy or save the notes. |
| **Quiz** | Generate 5 or 10 MCQs (Easy / Medium / Hard) from pasted text or saved notes. One question at a time, scored on the server, with explanations after submit. |
| **Planner** | Subjects, exam date, daily hours, session length and weak topics give a day-by-day timetable with tickable tasks. |
| **Progress** | Your saved roadmap goals only. Open a goal to see how much is complete and tick topics. |

**Study streak:** the streak counts only when you complete a topic in a roadmap goal. Unticking a topic removes it, so a day counts only while something from that day is still complete. Quizzes, notes and the planner do not affect the streak.

---

## Tech stack

- **Frontend:** React + Vite (JavaScript/JSX), Tailwind CSS v3, React Router, Lucide icons
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express (ES modules), Multer, unpdf, dotenv, CORS, express-rate-limit
- **AI:** Google Gemini via the official `@google/genai` SDK
- **Storage:** browser `localStorage` (no database or login)

